SUMMARY:Tree Planting at Asbury UMC
LOCATION:Asbury United Methodist Church, 4257 Kearneysville Pike, Shepherdstown, WV, United States
DESCRIPTION:Come help protect Town Run! Join Friends of Town Run and members of Asbury United Methodist Church for a hands-on tree planting event. Volunteers will help plant 17 native trees and shrubs\, including red maples\, river birch\, redbud\, dogwood\, sweetbay magnolia\, pin oak\, red oak\, and witch hazel. This planting will support local water quality\, […]
CATEGORIES:Education & Workshops, Outdoors & Nature
ORGANIZATION:Town Run Watershed
URL:https://townrunwatershed.org/event/tree-planting-at-asbury-umc/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
