SUMMARY:Capture the Rain
LOCATION:
DESCRIPTION:Capturing the Rain with Green Infrastructure Presentation by Sam Canfield. Included in the presentation will be a walking tour of rain gardens\, swales\, barrels\, and more. Join us on Thursday\, Apr. 30\, 2026\, from 2 – 4 PM at the Historic Reformed Church\, 304 East German Street.
